# Multimodal Transit ETA System (Vancouver / TransLink)

## Overview

Use a **2-layer system**:

### 1. Routing Layer  
- OSM road/walk network  
- GTFS static schedules  
- :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0} multimodal routing (`costing: "multimodal"`)

### 2. Prediction Layer  
- GTFS-RT (real-time feeds) + historical data  
- Real-time trip updates + vehicle positions  
- Model predicts delay / arrival offset from schedule  

**Final ETA = Scheduled ETA (routing) + Predicted delay**

